      "condition": "An earlier customer qualifies as a Non-consenting Customer.",
      "consequence": "The earlier trust relationship survives. Referral rewards, Gatecoin's delisting adjustments, delayed credits for earlier ARC or SAT subscriptions and third-party mining deposits do not themselves defeat that status, subject to evidence of relevant access or use. Logging in to withdraw TRX is materially different from an automatic delisting adjustment."
    },
