      "condition": "A customer relies on a limit order executed after the contractual change.",
      "consequence": "The annexure permits non-consenting treatment where earlier placement is proved through its notification and evidence process. Execution timing is not decisive. Do not extend that express exception to other transactions without addressing the differing narrative and annexure wording."
    },
