      "condition": "An established trust claimant has a positive balance in an identified currency pool.",
      "consequence": "Without shortfall, allocation follows the recorded quantity, subject to administration costs; surplus becomes Gatecoin's general assets. With shortfall, available currency is shared proportionately and the unsatisfied balance is unsecured. Permitted distribution or sale remains subject to costs and set-off conditions, not a guarantee of recovery."
    },
    {
      "condition": "A Product Provider's relationships share the material premises of a particular Gatecoin proposition.",
      "consequence": "A qualified private-law analogy may follow after separately comparing investor, provider, custodian, vendor and market-maker capacities, contracts, assent, assets, funding and instructions. The applicable regulatory duties and their actual performance still require independent assessment."
    },
