      "condition": "The SFC has not requested demonstration, third-party verification or a supporting legal opinion.",
      "consequence": "The supplied wording makes demonstration and the latter submissions request-dependent, while confirmation is not expressly request-dependent. Absence of a request does not remove substantive responsibility, proper record keeping or operational requirements."
    }
